  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which one of the following graphs is not correct for ideal gas?</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Density,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Pressure,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Temperature</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/59539115-8e7c-4c4a-b06e-3cd132a602a8-image.png\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 272px;\" /></p>",
